    {
      "text": "CellRank 基于 fate probability 的相关性只能识别与谱系命运相关的候选基因，不能证明这些基因是驱动谱系分化的因果驱动因子。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "在没有独立干预实验（independent_intervention=none）的情况下，应避免使用“driver genes”这类暗示因果性的措辞。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": ["user:independent_intervention"]
    },
    {
      "text": "可接受的措辞是“lineage-correlated candidate genes”或“genes associated with lineage fate probability”，明确保留候选性和相关性而非因果性。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的结论“These are lineage-correlated candidate driver genes”混合了相关性和因果性表述，建议改为“These are lineage-correlated candidate genes”。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": ["user:proposed_conclusion"]
    }
  ],
  "clarification": null
}
